OL,3,GNEWSAWorld's 'largest floating book
OL,4,Afair' docks in Belfast
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn internationally-crewed ship
OL,7,Fdescribed as the world's "largest
OL,8,Ffloating book fair" has berthed in
OL,9,FBelfast.
OL,11,FThe Logos Hope is a volunteer-run
OL,12,Fvessel with a Christian ethos and a
OL,13,Fbookshop of more than 5,000 titles.
OL,15,FIt was officially opened to people in
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland on Friday by Belfast
OL,17,FLord Mayor Rois-Maire Donelly and will
OL,18,Fremain open to the public at Albert
OL,19,FQuay until 20 October.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
