OL,3,GNEWSAWorld's 'largest floating book
OL,4,Afair' docks in Belfast
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoron Lukat, the managing director of
OL,7,Fthe ship, said Belfast was "one of the
OL,8,Ffirst" places the crew aim to visit
OL,9,Fwhen travelling to the UK and Europe.
